/-!
# Integral group-ring augmentation

This file develops the actual augmentation quotient `I_G / I_G²` used in
the transfer/augmentation comparison. It is kept separate from the transfer calculation so
that the group-ring identities can be reused in the proof of Witt's
transfer theorem.
-/

open scoped Pointwise

noncomputable section

namespace GroupTheory
namespace Augmentation

variable (G : Type*) [Group G]

/-- The integral group ring `ℤ[G]`. -/
abbrev IntegralGroupRing := MonoidAlgebra ℤ G








































































































































































































































































































































































































































































end Augmentation
end GroupTheory

end
